1.18.3: POLAJUICE_PROFILE - read a slow render stage by stage

POLAJUICE_PROFILE=1 prints the wall time of load, every pipeline
stage and save to stderr, with the thread count, so a render that is
slow on one machine can be diagnosed on that machine rather than
guessed at from a sandbox. Off, it costs one getenv per render.
pj_thread_count() joins the public API.
